/svg></button>以下數據為假設值，只比較溫室氣體排放。甲容器製造時排放 1,200 g CO₂e，每次清洗排放 8 g CO₂e；乙容器為一次性，每個製造及處置的總排放為 80 g CO₂e。假設兩種容器每次提供相同功能。<ol class=\"List-bYalj1\" data-d-component=\"list\" data-d-marker=\"number\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\" style=\"--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">若使用 10 次，哪種方案排放較少？</div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">甲容器至少使用幾次，累積排放才會低於乙方案？</div></div></li><li class=\"Item-EWTmaR\" data-d-component=\"list-item\" data-d-marker-layout=\"native\"><div class=\"Content-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">若考慮其他環境影響，是否能直接判定甲方案一定比較永續？為什麼？</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的想法或計算過程……\" id=\"_r_jk_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>檢查作答 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"InlineIcon-U9ZpYM\" data-d-component=\"icon\" data-d-inline=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);\"><path fil