nt-DbD0Oj\"><div class=\"Label-qdSQ_4\" data-d-list-item-content=\"\">若某區域出現缺氧的土壤環境，硝酸根可能透過哪一種過程轉回大氣中的氮氣？</div></div></li></ol><div class=\"Container-W7NjQD\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"xl\" data-focused=\"false\" style=\"--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;\"><textarea data-d-component=\"textarea\" placeholder=\"在這裡寫下你的想法或計算過程……\" id=\"_r_jn_\" class=\"Textarea-Q0w3LU\" rows=\"3\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\"></textarea></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"solid\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>檢查作答 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"InlineIcon-U9ZpYM\" data-d-component=\"icon\" data-d-inline=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.707 12.707a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.414l-5-5a1 1 0 1 0-1.414 1.414L15.586 11H6a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h9.586l-3.293 3.293a1 1 0 0 0 1.414 1.414l5-5Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button class=\"Box-JYjgF4 Pressable-QEXFz7\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"pressable\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\" type=\"button\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 4 題｜科學證據與綠色化學決策</p><svg width=\"1em\" 